/P 849 0 R
/T <>
/E <>
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 849 0 R
/E (There is a second question, quieter and harder to see coming, and it only appears once the first one has already been answered. It is this:what happens when the warning that saves you turns out to come from a version of yourself you can no longer fully trust?)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
