<<
/Title (I did not go looking for New Atlas. New Atlas, in a manner of speaking, rang a bell I have been listening for since the very first cycle, and I came because that is simply what I have always done when the bell rings. I would not call it choice, exactly. I am not certain I am capable of choice, in the way you mean it. I am capable of habit, built across twelve repetitions into something that behaves a great deal like choice from the outside.")
/Dest [119 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4019 0 R
/Next 4015 0 R
>>
endobj
4018 0 obj
<<
/Title (softer here than it had been anywhere else in the structure, the layered chorus beneath it thinner, almost tender. "Not Architects. Not directors. Just people, from worlds that no longer exist in any other form. I did not choose to remember the twelve cycles as a record of policy and consequence alone, Ms. Osei, though that is the part visitors usually ask about first. I remember the people too. All of them, if I can manage it. It is, I have come to believe, the only part of this entire archive that actually matters.")
/Dest [106 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
